From 4cc810ed6248037c10084165ca4c93f30090fe04 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 04:26:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] PS4: the touchpad's pointer as a ring, as Crema's

The touchpad's pointer was a cross. It is now drawn as Crema (the Wii U
emulator's PS4 port) draws its own: a ring of radius picture height / 50
with a dot in its middle, each with a dark outline. White while the
finger rests, red while it touches. The circles are drawn as one clear
rectangle per row.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01W5pLthrq7391gS4qodPV4u
---
 .../present/window_adapt_pass.cpp             | 67 +++++++++++--------
 1 file changed, 40 insertions(+), 27 deletions(-)

